                    // The wobble this correction steadies is local - a block's own. An edit that changes over hundreds
                    // of pixels at once is a real change (the lift in camera motion; the wall a figure has just passed
                    // settling, ~10 frames one way), and carrying it on kept the picture ~3 frames behind it: a faint
                    // wide patch behind the figure, plain on a dark wall. With the wide mean taken out, what is left of
                    // a wide change is its newest jump alone (and last frame's, see below).
