                // 1 .. N - 1 frames behind - (N - 1) / 2 of such a jump together. Additive and signed (a ratio that only
                // ever lowers the other slots took a third of a bright window's edit), from the wide mean of the young
                // places' jumps (a block's own jump is mostly its wobble), not in a place's first frames (see the store).
